    "template_only": [
      "seed_id",
      "version",
      "role_id",
      "port_id"
    ],
    "note": "role_id and port_id are never written to the engine; they are the template keys that the derived instance UUIDs and exchange ids map onto. The version string is inside every key, so a content change that needs a new identity gets one by raising the version."
  },
  "upstream_dataset_identity_warning": "The two catalog flows this seed does not own (injected natural gas and grid electricity) are the hydrogen seed's own mass and energy basis rows at nebula.standard-lca-seed/1.3.0, re-derived from that seed's identity and pinned to its bundle hash in model/flow-dependencies.json. They are not an upstream dataset identity, and the installer must re-run the read-only probes on the acceptance engine before trusting the stored observation.",
