          "sub_role_id": "sinter_agglomeration",
          "clause_refs": [
            "ST-03"
          ],
          "note": "Combustion of the coke breeze in the sinter bed. The breeze carbon becomes CO2 here and is the only sintering fuel source authored in version 1.1.0."
