          "clause_refs": [
            "ST-03",
            "ST-18"
          ],
          "note": "Decomposition of the limestone flux carbonates. ST-18 makes carbonate decomposition, including material used for flue gas cleaning, a process emission, so it may not be hung on a combustion factor."
        },
