          "sub_role_id": "sinter_flue_gas_cleaning_slot",
          "clause_refs": [
            "ST-18"
          ],
          "note": "Slot for the dedusting and flue gas cleaning reagents. No exchange is authored for it in version 1.1.0, which is modeling gap MG-S09; the slot exists so the omission is a stated gap rather than an invisible one."
